'''Sakura Sonic''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.1 Update|Version 10.1]] improves her toughness against [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies and gains her own single-slot [[Cat Combo|Combo]], [[Ninjutsu Cute (Combo)|Ninjutsu Cute]]. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] increases her health, damage, [[Critical Hit]] chance, Slow and Weaken time, gains [[Omni Strike]] and has another single-slot Combo, [[TopSecret (Combo)|#TopSecret]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she appears through the [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] event in the '''JP''' Version and [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]] for '''SEA''' and '''WW''' versions.

